  "releaseNotes": "Coordinate overlapping Owner/Fleet token refreshes, reads, site changes and reconnects; prevent stale cache replacement and late session publication after disposal. Serialize token-file updates across cache instances and processes with atomic replacement. Retain native energy fetch failures instead of fabricated zeroes. Assembly identity and runtime dependencies remain compatible. See RELEASE-NOTES.md.",
